1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,300
Day 4 in
Leoville!

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,400
81 comments yesterday…

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,800
…and 62 of them
are from Mats!

4
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:09,200
He calls himself
"the town comment spammer"!

5
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,200
He wants a comment
spam contest…

6
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:12,800
…but he already won!

7
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:15,000
Still, that's
€124 for the town!

8
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:17,100
Yesterday: 89 residents.

9
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:19,300
Today, we are 101!

10
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:22,400
That brings
€12,176 into the budget!

11
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,500
UserFromRO gets
a house with an M5!

12
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:26,800
Salih gets
a villa!

13
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:29,300
Bob wanted
to live on the mountain…

14
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:30,900
A cabin by the spring!

15
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:33,900
Iain, cnaaitsirh and Sanulatesade:
your homes come next!

16
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:36,700
Thomas wanted
a fence and a basketball court…

17
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:38,100
Done!

18
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:41,100
Kalilay, Camille and 7 more
move into the apartment block!

19
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:44,100
doodle
wants to be president too!

20
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:46,300
The election has
5 candidates now!

21
00:00:46,300 --> 00:00:48,900
Divish and Alex
have 1 vote each!

22
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:50,900
Reply with a name
to vote!

23
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:52,900
"D bucks", doodle?

24
00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:55,100
Sorry, Leoville pays
in euros!

25
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:57,300
A revolution, Barhoum?

26
00:00:57,300 --> 00:00:59,500
Leoville has no king…
yet!

27
00:00:59,900 --> 00:01:02,100
Mats is lonely
in the robot house…

28
00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:04,500
Who wants to
move in with Mats?

29
00:01:04,900 --> 00:01:06,900
And what do you
want next?

30
00:01:06,900 --> 00:01:09,300
Military Base and school
are tied!

31
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:11,800
The school costs
€120,000.

32
00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:14,000
Today we spent a lot
on your homes…

33
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:16,400
Keep subscribing,
and we can build it!

34
00:01:16,500 --> 00:01:18,900
Who should lead
Leoville?

35
00:01:18,900 --> 00:01:21,300
Vote in the
comments!
